 # Replacing the Placeholder Artwork
 
-Everything visual in this gallery is a **stand-in**. All artwork, titles, tags
+**Status (2026-10-19):** hero + works 01–04 now carry original AVP artwork
+("Beneath the Red Moon", "The Screaming Void", "Cosmic Phoenix Ascending",
+"Beyond Form"). **Work 05 is the last placeholder** — swap it with any
+portrait piece (≈ 4:5, export 1330×1400, JPG q~80) and clear its
+"Replace Me" flag.
+
+Everything visual still flagged below is a **stand-in**. All artwork, titles, tags
 and alt text are meant to be swapped for your real portfolio pieces.
 
